OL,3,AAlan Carr holds back tears on special
OL,4,Anight at National Television Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to BBC News on the red carpet
OL,7,Fbefore the ceremony, Carr had played
OL,8,Fdown his chances of winning for his
OL,9,Fsemi-autobiographical comedy Changing
OL,10,FEnds.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
