OL,3,AGlastonbury confirms ticket sale dates
OL,4,A- and highest ever price
OL,5,
OL,6,FTickets for the festival typically sell
OL,7,Fout in less than an hour, with
OL,8,Fthousands of fans joining online queues
OL,9,Fto fight for their place.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
